# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Root .dockerignore for Netra Uptime Monorepo
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Non-Runtime Directories (Not needed inside Docker build context)
.git
.github
.vscode
.idea
cli
scripts
docs

# Sensitive Environment & Auto-Generated Secrets
.env
.env.*
*.env
**/.env
**/.env.*
.netra_secret
**/.netra_secret

# SQLite Databases & Runtime Journals
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.db-journal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3

# Dependencies & Build Artifacts
**/node_modules
**/build
!server/internal/static/build
!server/internal/static/build/**
**/.svelte-kit
**/dist
.output
.vercel
.wrangler
tmp
**/tmp
*.exe
*.test
*.out
*.log

# Tests & Reports
**/*_test.go
**/tests
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
*.md
